flowchart TB
    TITLE[SSH Log Analysis and Brute-Force Detection with Splunk]

    subgraph SOURCE[Log Source - VirtualBox]
      direction TB
      VM[Ubuntu VM - Bridged Networking]
      SSH[SSH Service]
      LOG[Authentication Log - auth.log]
      UF[Splunk Universal Forwarder]
      VM --> SSH --> LOG --> UF
    end

    subgraph SIEM[Splunk Enterprise - Windows PC]
      direction TB
      RECV[Receiving Port 9997]
      IDX[(linux index)]
      SEARCH[SPL Detection Searches<br/>Attacker IP · Failed Login Trends<br/>Failed vs Successful Ratio]
      ALERT[Alert<br/>3 or more failed logins<br/>within 5 minutes]
      DASH[3-Panel Dashboard<br/>Top Attacker IPs<br/>Failed Logins Over Time<br/>Failed vs Successful]
      MITRE[MITRE ATT&CK<br/>T1110 - Brute Force]
      RECV --> IDX --> SEARCH
      SEARCH --> ALERT
      SEARCH --> DASH
      SEARCH --> MITRE
    end

    TITLE --> VM
    UF -->|Forward SSH authentication events| RECV

